      "content": "the way you put it... it's kind of scary but also a relief. like, i've been fighting so hard to keep the lights on, trying to remember who I was or how to fix it. but maybe fighting it is what's actually hurting me? it just feels so exhausting to keep pretending there's still something there to save.",
